# Local review/preview deployment folder — regenerable build output (154 MB), made by:
#   VONK_PREVIEW=1 npm run build -- --out-dir preview/VonkUltra
# Ignored because the repo is now the deploy SOURCE (GitHub Pages builds from it), so the
# prebuilt copy has no ongoing role. Keep it out of git regardless: 154 MB on a Hobby
# Vercel account exceeds the 100 MB CLI upload ceiling, and it would double the repo.
# ⚠️ preview/ also holds three HAND-WRITTEN files at its root — index.html, _redirects,
# vercel.json — that no build regenerates. Recreate them if the Vercel/Netlify route is
# ever needed again; they are documented in 00-planning/remaining-work.md.
/preview
